{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"games","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"List a game's markets"},"description":"Every stored Polymarket market of one event_slug, of every type, plus its child events' markets (a soccer game's exact score, halftime result), each with its own event_slug. Ordered by sports_market_type, then line, then condition_id. Pass a condition_id to get_market_holders, get_market_flow or get_market_snapshot; get_game_holders reads several markets' holders in one call.\n\nsettlement says how Polymarket's oracle settled or is settling the market: oracle_status, the provider lifecycle state (proposed, disputed, resolved); payouts, micro-USDC per share per outcome index; result, the outcome or split for a 50-50; resolved_at, null on a resolved UMA question row; oracle_updated_at, Polymarket's latest lifecycle change, never a resolution time; observed_at, when we first saw the settlement, which never moves. A null is unknown.\n\nfamilies lists every market type the event holds with its market and active counts, whatever the filters: read it first to choose a sports_market_type. A slug no stored market carries answers 404. Prices come only with expand quotes. protocol_version is v1 (CTF) or v2 (Protocol V2, whose token_id is a V2 position id).","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cursor":{"description":"Opaque gmk_v1_ cursor from next_cursor, used with the same filters","type":"string"},"event_slug":{"description":"The game's event slug from list_games, get_game or a search_markets result, for example nba-bos-orl-2026-11-01; matched case-insensitively. Live, upcoming and settled events all answer","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"expand":{"description":"sharp_money adds each row's sharp_money, the game page's per-line split; the first read of a game can be unavailable while its split is built, so retry after a few seconds. quotes adds each outcome's quote, the figures get_market_snapshot reads, on every plan. status no_orderbook: the provider confirmed the outcome has no book; unavailable, every figure null: nothing is cached yet and the read starts covering the page's open markets, so read again after a few seconds. price_basis is midpoint when the best bid and ask are at most $0.10 apart, else last_trade. book_depth_within_2c is the USD resting on each side within 2 cents of the midpoint, from the whole book. book_unavailable_reason cache_unavailable: read again; stream_capacity: reading again does not help until fewer markets are read. A null figure is one the cache does not hold, but a null best_bid or best_ask beside book_observed_at is a side with no orders. It adds 1 to the cost. trading_terms adds each row's trading_terms, Polymarket's figures from the market's Gamma record, never derived, on every plan. status not_listed: Gamma returns no record for it; unavailable, every figure null: read again after a few seconds. rebate_rate is the fraction of taker fees rebated to the resting maker; rewards_min_size and min_order_size_shares are shares, not USDC; rewards_max_spread is cents from the midpoint; seconds_delay is the wait before a new marketable order can match. trading, the exchange, EIP-712 domain version, verifying contract and balance asset_type an order signs for, comes from protocol_version and negative_risk. It adds 1 to the cost","items":{"enum":["sharp_money","quotes","trading_terms"],"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"limit":{"default":20,"description":"Max results (1-100, default 20)","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"protocol_version":{"description":"v1 (CTF) or v2 (Protocol V2); omitted keeps both","enum":["v1","v2"],"type":"string"},"sports_market_type":{"description":"Comma-separated provider market types to keep, case-insensitive: spreads, totals, points, first_half_totals. Omitted keeps every type; an unknown type returns an empty page","type":"string"},"status":{"default":"all","description":"Keep only active or only closed markets; default all","enum":["active","closed","all"],"type":"string"}},"required":["event_slug"],"type":"object"},"name":"list_game_markets","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"ResponseMeta":{"properties":{"cache_age_s":{"type":"integer"},"cached":{"type":"boolean"},"category_skill_base_payload_hash":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"category_skill_enriched_base_payload_hash":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"category_skill_model_operationally_degraded":{"type":"boolean"},"category_skill_model_version":{"type":"string"},"category_skill_observation_started_at":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"category_skill_platform":{"const":"polymarket","type":"string"},"category_skill_scope":{"const":"observed_goldsky_primary_taker_fill","type":"string"},"category_skill_source":{"enum":["live","partial","degraded","unavailable"],"type":"string"},"category_skill_source_coverage":{"enum":["partial_whale_threshold_fills","graded_wallet_fills"],"type":"string"},"category_skill_status_counts":{"properties":{"degraded":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"insufficient":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"live":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"stale":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"unknown":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["live","insufficient","stale","unknown","degraded"],"type":"object"},"category_skill_taxonomy_version":{"type":"string"},"continued_from_generation":{"type":"integer"},"cost":{"type":"integer"},"directional_source":{"enum":["live","degraded"],"type":"string"},"ranking_as_of":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"ranking_generation":{"type":"integer"},"ranking_source":{"enum":["live","db_only"],"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["request_id","cached","cost"],"type":"object"}},"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"data":{"items":{"properties":{"condition_id":{"type":"string"},"event_slug":{"type":"